#: src/iconlib/cmd/main.py:48
msgid ""
"Commands:\n"
"  search [pattern]   list matching icon names\n"
"  which [-a] name    print icon path(s)\n"
"  info name          print icon metadata\n"
"  libraries          list discovered icon libraries\n"
"  pull [pattern]     copy icons into the project\n"
"  push [pattern]     upload icons (not implemented)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   open themestylebrowser\n"
"  index              generate web preview and/or FAISS index\n"
"  delete name...     remove local icon files\n"
"  rename old new     rename local icon files\n"
"  copy from to       copy local icon files\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  link local icon files\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  derive local variants\n"
"\n"
"Pattern: empty=all, exact name, glob, or /regex\n"
"Plain English words also match synonyms/inflections (scored).\n"
"Local commands operate under project-dir/local-dir (default: icons/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Perintah:\n"
"  search [pattern]   daftar nama ikon yang cocok\n"
"  which [-a] name    cetak jalur ikon\n"
"  info name          cetak metadata ikon\n"
"  libraries          daftar pustaka ikon yang ditemukan\n"
"  pull [pattern]     salin ikon ke proyek\n"
"  push [pattern]     unggah ikon (belum diimplementasikan)\n"
"  browse [pattern]   buka themestylebrowser\n"
"  index              buat pratampil web dan/atau indeks FAISS\n"
"  delete name...     hapus berkas ikon lokal\n"
"  rename old new     ganti nama berkas ikon lokal\n"
"  copy from to       salin berkas ikon lokal\n"
"  ln [-sf] tgt name  tautkan berkas ikon lokal\n"
"  make [-s SIZE] [-F FMT] name...  turunkan varian lokal\n"
"\n"
"Pola: kosong=semua, nama tepat, glob, atau /regex\n"
"Kata Inggris biasa juga mencocokkan sinonim/infleksi (ber skor).\n"
"Perintah lokal beroperasi di project-dir/local-dir (bawaan: icons/).\n"

#: src/iconlib/cmd/main.py:72
